{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51943","headline":"朗州戏笔（二首） 一 · 吕岩","name":"朗州戏笔（二首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卖墨遨游到朗州，无端太守问因由。\n家居北斗星辰下，剑挂南山月角头。\n朝觐玉皇登宝殿，暮随王母宴琼楼。\n知君相见不相识，回首白云归去休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}